---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="CompareVue is an independent software review site. We test tools, compare features, and help businesses make smarter buying decisions."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">About CompareVue</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray mt-8 max-w-none">
      <p>We built CompareVue because <strong>choosing software sucks</strong>. Every tool promises to be "the best" — but best for who? A 5-person startup needs different things than a 500-person enterprise.</p>
      <h2>How We Test</h2>
      <p>We sign up for every tool we review. We test real workflows, not demos. We check support response times, mobile app quality, and the actual onboarding experience. No tool pays for placement, and we clearly label affiliate links when they exist.</p>
      <h2>Our Rating Criteria</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Ease of use</strong> — How fast can a new team get productive?</li>
        <li><strong>Features</strong> — Does the tool actually solve the problem?</li>
        <li><strong>Pricing</strong> — Is the value proportional to the cost?</li>
        <li><strong>Integrations</strong> — Does it plug into your existing stack?</li>
        <li><strong>Support</strong> — What happens when something breaks?</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click and buy, we may earn a commission — at no extra cost to you. This doesn't affect our ratings. We regularly recommend free tools and tools with no affiliate program.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
